@baseUrl = http://localhost:5121

### 1. Get all orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### 2. Filter orders by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=Processing
Accept: application/json

### 3. Search orders by customer or address
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?search=Alice
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get order statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/statistics
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get order detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Create a new order with items
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "David Pham",
  "shippingAddress": "789 Nguyen Thi Minh Khai, District 3, HCMC",
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "Ergonomic Office Chair",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 189.99
    },
    {
      "productName": "Lumbar Support Cushion",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 29.50
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Update order status (Set-based UPDATE)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Delivered"
}

### 8. Delete order (Set-based DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/2
